0 70 560 [
[(If you want actively changing center frequencies, use [vcf~] or [bob~] instead)]
[(of [bp~]. The [vcf~] module takes an audio signal to set center frequency \050Q is)]
[(still set by messages though\051, which makes it computationally somewhat more)]
[(expensive than [bp~] and has two outputs, the left behaves as bandpass like)]
[([bp~] and the right output is a nit more like a resonant lowpass filter.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 70 482 [
[(For a true resonant lowpass filter, check [bob~], which is even more expensive)]
[(and emulates the sound of the moog filter. It takes a signal to change the)]
[(resonant frequency as well as the 'Q' factor. Check the help file of both. Note)]
[(the different effects of negative and positive sweep speeds.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
